<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority EPS view cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it cut its fourth quarter earnings estimate on Sports Authority Inc TSA.N to $0.50 a share from a previous estimate of $0.53 a share.</p>
<p>-- Lowered the fourth quarter estimate for same-store sales gains to one percent from three percent.</p>
<p>-- Cited weakness during the holiday shopping period.</p>
<p>-- Maintained the strong buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares lost 4-1/4 to 17-3/8 in afternoon trade.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
